WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.280
It can't be!

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.910
Yes, it can.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:10.180
Level 2 Valkyrie of the Nordic Ascendant 
tunes two Level 4 Einherjar Tokens!

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:15.170
The almighty king that rules 
the northern polar sky!

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.040
It's time to control the gods of the 
Polar World and show your authority!

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.720
Synchro Summon!

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.640
Rule the heavens and earth!

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:29.560
The ultimate god, Odin, Father of the Aesir!

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:38.220
It's the third god.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.120
Odin, Father of the Aesir.

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:43.900
The third god Odin finally appeared!

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.950
What an impressive sight!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:50.400
Now all three gods are 
on Team Ragnarok's field!

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:57.610
How will Team 5D's Yusei Fudo battle 
against these powerful enemies?

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.530
That's the third god Odin.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:03.710
He gathered them so easily.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:08.080
Thor negates and absorbs monster effects.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.370
Loki negates and destroys a 
trap during the Battle Phase.

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:15.390
And Odin rules all the gods.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:19.610
He has three monsters with powerful 
effects and attack points.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.830
They're also immortal.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:28.320
But Yusei's trap card Monster 
Chain's effect is active.

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:33.270
As long as he has that trap, neither 
player can attack for three more turns.

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:36.740
During that time, he must 
prepare for the attack.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:41.920
Yusei, you wanted to buy time 
against Thor and Loki...

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:46.640
...but instead, you gave me the 
best opportunity to summon Odin.

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:52.050
Odin is the all-knowing 
god in Norse Mythology.

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:57.520
You're foolish to think that Monster 
Chain will prevent me from attacking.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:58.480
What?

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.060
Watch the power of the mightiest god!

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:05.090
I activate Odin, Father 
of the Aesir's effect!

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:07.330
Influence of Rune!

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:13.720
When Odin is on the field, it negates 
spells and traps against the gods!

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:14.660
What?

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:23.660
Harald is going for it.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:26.870
Here I go, Yusei!

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:30.890
Battle!  Loki, Lord of the Aesir attacks!

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:32.720
Vanity Bullet!

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:37.110
Thor, Lord of the Aesir attacks!

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:38.100
Thunder Pyle!

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:42.820
Odin, Father of the Aesir attacks!

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.450
Heaven's Judgment!

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:52.220
Yusei, all your monsters are destroyed.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:57.380
No matter how great of a duelist you 
are, you're powerless against the gods!

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:01.280
This is Odin's power...

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.220
Riding Duels.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:08.330
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:15.210
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:36.490
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:46.600
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:52.840
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:58.780
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:04.560
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:10.160
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:16.530
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:22.340
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:28.610
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:34.950
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:04.980
The Immortal Three Aesir!Roar, 
Majestic Star Dragon!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:11.510
This is bad.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.530
All the monsters on Yusei's 
field are destroyed.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:18.220
Now he can't stop the gods' attacks.

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:22.210
Damn!  Monster Chain's effect 
has completely backfired!

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:25.900
Unless things change, 
only Yusei can't attack.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:30.930
On Yusei's next turn, he must find a 
way to withstand the gods' attacks.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.320
Traps and spells don't work.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.320
Is there any way to survive?

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.780
Yusei hasn't given up yet.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.860
That's right!  Yusei won't lose!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.980
Yusei overcomes any pinch.

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.530
Yusei, do your best.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.430
This match is ours.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:54.210
No duelist can oppose three gods.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:00.370
The battle between the three Aesir 
and the Crimson Dragon is great!

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:03.370
They've created a lot of the Circuit!

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:06.940
No matter which team reaches the 
finals, the Circuit will still

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:10.110
be completed because both 
teams have a lot of power!

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.790
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:25.760
Yusei, I've lived for this battle.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:36.790
Master Harald...

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:42.200
This is Odin, a family secret 
passed down through the ages.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:46.700
According to legend, Fimbulwinter is coming.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:50.510
It will lead to Ragnarok, 
the world's final battle.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:56.230
That's when you must battle as 
a duelist and protect the world.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.430
That is your duty.

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:03.550
When you become a duelist 
worthy of this card,

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:08.110
Odin's Eyes will open, and this 
card's true power will be unleashed.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:13.590
When that happens, you will 
become Odin's true successor.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:21.120
I obeyed my destiny, and I traveled 
around the world on a duel pilgrimage.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:30.830
During my journey, I learned firsthand 
what was really happening in the world.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:39.260
Struggles enveloped the people of the 
world.  The people were powerless.

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:44.370
By improving myself, I 
could now see the truth.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.480
I'm back, Sebastian.

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.950
Welcome home, young master.

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:13.930
I found friends who would battle alongside 
me, and I won the trust of the gods.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:20.250
So that I can battle against 
the true enemy during the WRGP!

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:24.790
Yusei, we can't let you 
interfere in our mission!

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:28.770
Each of the three Aesir has enormous power.

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:32.460
When the three gods are 
together, the gods' effects

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:35.610
support each other and 
unleash even more power!

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:41.350
The difference in our powers is evident.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:44.580
Surrender!  It's for your own good.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.610
If all three Aesir attack you, 
you won't escape unharmed!

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:54.090
Since you control the gods, your 
team is more powerful than mine.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:59.150
But there's something I must do in the WRGP!

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.120
Something you must do?

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.790
You said it yourself.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:08.460
Your father Professor 
Fudo caused Zero Reverse.

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:14.240
Since you're part of his bloodline, 
you have a destiny of destruction.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:20.040
My heart didn't want to accept what you said.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.010
But my father said...

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:26.520
Yusei, you can't let that approach.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:37.360
My father's consciousness lives inside there.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.170
Professor Fudo?

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:43.840
I was born at the same time 
as this city's destruction.

00:09:56.180 --> 00:10:01.750
Like you said, my destiny of 
destruction may not be over yet.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:11.180
If my destiny is pulling that thing 
closer, then my mission is to stop it.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:15.710
If your destiny is to battle Iliaster, 
then it's the same for me!

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:19.370
In order to win this 
mission with my own hands,

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:23.340
I must settle things with Iliaster 
and protect Neo Domino City!

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:26.320
In order to do that, I'm 
willing to risk my life!

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:28.540
That's how committed I am!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:30.250
Yusei...

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:35.770
That's why I won't give up until the 
final moment when I run out of power!

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:40.680
That was...

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:53.200
That's the mark of the Crimson Dragon.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.730
In order to stop the three Aesir's attacks...

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.430
Here I go!  My turn!

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:08.780
I activate Speed Spell - 
Angel Baton from my hand!

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:13.250
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters, 
I draw two cards from my deck,

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:17.180
and I send one card in 
my hand to the graveyard.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:20.660
Then I summon Debris Dragon!

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:26.210
A Tuner Monster?

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.410
He's planning to Synchro Summon.

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:30.940
When Debris Dragon is successfully 
summoned, I can Special Summon

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:34.310
one monster from my graveyard 
with 500 or fewer attack points.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:36.800
I Special Summon Cosmic Compass!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:44.270
When a Tuner is on my field, I can Special 
Summon Quillbolt Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:50.720
When a monster is Special 
Summoned from my graveyard,

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:53.780
I can Special Summon 
Doppelwarrior from my hand!

00:11:56.260 --> 00:12:02.470
Level 4 Debris Dragon tunes Level 2 
Doppelwarrior and Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:06.240
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.810
Become the path that lights the way!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.440
Synchro Summon!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.270
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:15.580
Stardust Dragon!

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:20.870
But those attack points can't 
stand up against a god!

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.080
Doppelwarrior's effect activates!

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:28.550
When it's used as Synchro Material, I 
Special Summon a Doppel Token on my field!

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:34.460
I activate Speed Spell 
- Overtune from my hand!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:40.850
When I have 3 or more Speed Counters, 
I tribute one monster on my field

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:45.590
to Special Summon a Tuner Monster 
from my hand with the same Level!

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.550
Another Tuner?

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:50.350
I tribute Level 1 Doppel Token!

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:53.440
I Special Summon Majestic Dragon!

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:04.920
Level 1 Majestic Dragon tunes Level 8 
Stardust Dragon and Level 1 Cosmic Compass!

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:11.360
The shining stars come together 
to illuminate a new miracle!

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:12.910
Become the path that lights the way!

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.810
Synchro Summon!

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:18.750
Arrive, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:22.870
This is...

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:24.320
The power of the Crimson Dragon!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.170
Majestic Star Dragon!

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.310
What's that?

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:36.530
That card isn't in our data!

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:38.740
This monster is...

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.690
This monster is the embodiment 
of the Crimson Dragon!

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:48.480
However...

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:58.360
After he went through the trouble of summoning 
Majestic Star Dragon with 3800 attack points...

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:03.260
Yusei can't attack until 
Monster Chain's effect ends.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:10.400
When Cosmic Compass is used as Synchro 
Material, I get to draw one card!

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:12.750
It's here!

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:15.390
I'm counting on this card to make a comeback!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.870
I set one card!

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:22.090
Then I activate my Continuous 
Trap Stay Force!

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:25.800
By paying 1000 life points 
during my turn's End Phase,

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:29.280
Majestic Star Dragon's 
field-leaving effect is negated!

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.070
I end my turn.

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:35.420
Yusei Fudo is planning to do something.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.260
But it'll be pointless.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.000
Harald's Odin is almighty.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:43.530
It will reveal all his schemes.

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.320
My turn!

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:50.960
Yusei, my god Odin has 4000 attack points!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:54.680
Majestic Star Dragon has 3800 attack points!

00:14:54.680 --> 00:15:01.370
Your strategy relies on using that 
monster to get out of this pinch.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.800
But cheap tricks don't work against Odin!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.830
I activate my trap Odin's Eye!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:13.660
Yusei, Majestic Star Dragon 
can't negate this card's effect.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:14.290
What?

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:19.730
When a god is on the field, you 
can't negate Odin's Eye's effect.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:29.910
Once per turn, I can negate the gods' effects to 
either look at one of your set cards or your hand!

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:33.510
I choose that set card!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.050
Now I understand.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:46.410
That set card is Wave Rebound!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:49.390
Wave Rebound negates a Synchro Monster from

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:52.630
being Special Summoned from 
the graveyard this turn...

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:57.370
...and the opponent takes damage 
equal to its attack points.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.750
Majestic Star Dragon is on the field.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:06.150
If I used Odin's power to negate 
Monster Chain's effect...

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:11.010
I was waiting for this moment!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.540
I activate Majestic Star Dragon's effect!

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:19.320
If you activate a spell, trap or monster 
effect, I can tribute Majestic Star Dragon

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:24.410
to negate its activation and 
destroy all cards on your field!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.070
Next, I activate the trap Wave Rebound.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:34.500
During this turn's End Phase, 
your gods do not resurrect,

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:37.540
and you take damage equal 
to their attack points!

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.490
That's the combo you were aiming for.

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:51.950
If I activated Odin's effect, 
I definitely would've lost.

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:56.010
Yusei, that's a terrifying strategy.

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:59.290
But it doesn't work against me!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:02.800
He figured out my plans.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:09.030
Even though he's at a huge disadvantage, 
Yusei Fudo is trying to win.

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:13.620
Despite facing the three Aesir, you're 
still stoking my battle spirit.

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:20.080
When battling against the gods, you must 
push your wisdom and courage to their limits.

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:23.550
Yusei, you are a worthy opponent.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:29.020
Let's settle things between our 
gods and your Crimson Dragon!

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:32.990
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.960
They're at a standstill!

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:39.770
Both players can't do anything!

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:44.810
This duel will be determined 
by a single move!

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:48.390
If only Yusei's combo worked...

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:55.480
The D-Wheeler Harald is in an advantageous 
situation, but he still figured out Yusei's trap.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:58.460
He has incredible skill in avoiding danger.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:03.760
Yusei can only keep Majestic Star 
Dragon for three more turns.

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:08.070
But Monster Chain's effect 
will end on Yusei's next turn.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:12.290
At that time, Yusei will get 
a chance to counterattack.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:16.910
Yusei and Harald's tactics are 
about to enter the final stage!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.810
It'll all be decided then!

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:21.190
My turn!

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:25.580
I use Speed World 2's effect.

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:30.390
I remove 7 Speed Counters 
to draw an additional card!

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.760
The Continuous Trap Stay Force's effect!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:39.740
By paying 1000 life points, I negate 
Majestic Star Dragon's field-leaving effect!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.830
I end my turn.

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.100
My turn!

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:49.640
Yusei, are you prepared 
for the decisive battle?

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:56.470
You're planning to attack when Monster 
Chain's effect ends, but I won't let that happen.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:01.840
The gods' battle always defies 
a player's expectations.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:06.830
Only the duelists chosen by destiny 
will be blessed in that battle!

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:10.290
I'll bet on my destiny this turn!

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:13.600
I activate Odin, Father 
of the Aesir's effect!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.770
Influence of Rune!

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:16.890
What?

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:19.230
Why is he using his god's effect now?

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:22.150
I thought he figure out Yusei's combo!

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:26.610
When Odin is on the field, spells and 
traps against the gods are negated!

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:29.810
I activate Majestic Star Dragon's effect!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:33.660
When you activate a spell, 
trap or monster effect,

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:40.520
I can tribute this card to negate it and 
destroy all the cards on your field!

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:42.190
Stardust Force!

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:14.950
I set one card and end my turn!

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:19.650
The gods resurrect during the End Phase!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:27.650
Resurrect, Thor!  Loki!  Odin!

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:47.270
I activate the trap card Wave Rebound!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:53.450
Incredible!  All the gods are destroyed!

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:58.400
Team Ragnarok's Harald takes damage equal 
to the three gods' total attack points!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:02.430
Team 5D's has made a 
come-from-behind victory!

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:05.290
Good, Yusei!

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:07.140
That's what you had to do!

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:10.410
Show all your strategies to the gods!

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:13.120
What are you thinking?

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.820
I activate a trap from the graveyard!

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:17.910
A trap from the graveyard?

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:22.630
Gjallarhorn unleashes its effect 
when it's in the graveyard.

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:40.750
When Asgard's guard Heimdallr blows 
Gjallarhorn, the final war Ragnarok begins.

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:44.180
Yusei, this duel is almost over.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:46.360
This trap will bury you!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:56.290
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:56.760 --> 00:22:03.000
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:21.250
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:26.890
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:32.500
You do this over and over

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:38.240
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:43.640
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.180 --> 00:22:51.120
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:56.850
Close to you   If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.260 --> 00:23:02.690
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:02.860 --> 00:23:08.170
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:16.270
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
